# L §6.4 (a rule's v included), §8.3 (tally 2.1.6, issue #75): a base rule whose v names raise_2027, a version only
# the scenario's file declares, is LOAD-SCENARIO `<item> of the base names <v> of scenario <s>`, not LOAD-NAME's
# `names no version` (tally 2.1.5's refcore). T's held scen/scenario-names; the engine's bytes.
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): a model and a scenario over it, scen.tally; it loads clean"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN at reader
  rule base v raise_2027 = amt + amt

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== scen.tally
scenario raised over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version raise_2027
  cite card
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-02-01
  replace amt = 150.00 PLN "a raise from 2027"

ask q_raised: doubled in raised law 2027-06-01
=== expect q
refused: LOAD-SCENARIO doubled of the base names raise_2027 of scenario raised (model.tally:15)
